{"3560100": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Rope It Two", "steam_appid": 3560100, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎮 About the Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rope It Two</strong> is a fun and chaotic multiplayer game you can play with up to 8 friends.<br>The goal is simple: use your ropes to climb, grapple, pull your friends, and complete the stages together!<br>But remember, the road to success won’t be easy… obstacles, traps, and surprises are everywhere!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🪢 Rope Mechanic</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can use your ropes to grab onto walls, platforms, or objects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can pull your teammates up or rescue them from tricky situations.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560100/extras/fa77bd3e6c923e2ecf48cf9835ba9d66.poster.avif?t=1785309958\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560100/extras/fa77bd3e6c923e2ecf48cf9835ba9d66.webm?t=1785309958\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560100/extras/fa77bd3e6c923e2ecf48cf9835ba9d66.mp4?t=1785309958\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🤝 Teamwork and Chaos</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rope It Two</strong> offers a great experience for those who love cooperation. While trying to save your friend, you might accidentally drop them, or just when you think you’ve perfectly aligned the laser, you could trigger total chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560100/extras/a67de766f31c36c3edde62e70f1ec11b.poster.avif?t=1785309958\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560100/extras/a67de766f31c36c3edde62e70f1ec11b.webm?t=1785309958\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560100/extras/a67de766f31c36c3edde62e70f1ec11b.mp4?t=1785309958\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you’re looking for a fun, laughter-filled, and chaotic adventure with your friends, <strong>Rope It Two</strong> is just for you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every stage will create a unique experience and story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎮 About the Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rope It Two</strong> is a fun and chaotic multiplayer game you can play with up to 8 friends.<br>The goal is simple: use your ropes to climb, grapple, pull your friends, and complete the stages together!<br>But remember, the road to success won’t be easy… obstacles, traps, and surprises are everywhere!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🪢 Rope Mechanic</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can use your ropes to grab onto walls, platforms, or objects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can pull your teammates up or rescue them from tricky situations.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560100/extras/fa77bd3e6c923e2ecf48cf9835ba9d66.poster.avif?t=1785309958\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560100/extras/fa77bd3e6c923e2ecf48cf9835ba9d66.webm?t=1785309958\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560100/extras/fa77bd3e6c923e2ecf48cf9835ba9d66.mp4?t=1785309958\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🤝 Teamwork and Chaos</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rope It Two</strong> offers a great experience for those who love cooperation. While trying to save your friend, you might accidentally drop them, or just when you think you’ve perfectly aligned the laser, you could trigger total chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560100/extras/a67de766f31c36c3edde62e70f1ec11b.poster.avif?t=1785309958\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560100/extras/a67de766f31c36c3edde62e70f1ec11b.webm?t=1785309958\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560100/extras/a67de766f31c36c3edde62e70f1ec11b.mp4?t=1785309958\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you’re looking for a fun, laughter-filled, and chaotic adventure with your friends, <strong>Rope It Two</strong> is just for you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every stage will create a unique experience and story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Rope It 2 is a chaotic co-op party platformer for 1-8 players! Race through tricky levels, solve puzzles, and push your friends (literally) to victory. Falling is easy — winning? Not so much!", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil, Traditional Chinese, Japanese, Korean, Russian, Thai, Turkish", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560100/8b969e229e3f5b567f719b4a08c8e223eebed7da/header.jpg?t=1785309958", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560100/727a397bd9710116a0468a19c3496499b62b7f36/capsule_231x